  "description": "MOCQUU crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C198 H228 Dy9 N30 O36 P6 3+,2(C1 N1 S1 1-),Cl1 1-,4(C3 H7 N1 O1),5(C2 H3 N1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2O (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2P (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2Q (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.354-4.493 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.74-114.65°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy9(L1)6(O3PC10H7)6(μ6-Cl)(SCN)2(DMF)6]·4DMF·5MeCN·H2O.",
